────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 KEYS                                                                           
                                                                                
  ↑ ↓  j k      move between steps, or scroll the detail pane                   
  space  x      select or deselect the step under the cursor                    
  tab           switch between the list and the detail pane                     
  enter         review the selection: what apply will do                        
  y             on the review: apply; in a question: yes                        
  esc  n        go back, or answer no                                           
  ?             close this help                                                 
  q             quit without applying anything                                  
                                                                                
  Selecting changes nothing. Safe steps start selected, opt in, networking and  
  access-critical steps start off. Networking and access-critical steps ask     
  before they join the selection. Apply runs only after the review screen and   
  your y there, with the same code as stackward apply, and prints what it did   
  when the list closes.                                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
